 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Fate — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>Finally at 18th level, you have learned to expand your domain. At initiative 20, you select a creature within your domain as your <em>Destined Foe</em>. While your <em>Destined Foe</em> is within your domain, all your attacks against them are imbued with your guaranteed hit. You can switch your <em>Destined Foe</em> to another creature at initiative 20. </p>\n<p>Your innate technique features count your domain as being within range and you can ignore the Touch Requirement of Fates.</p>",
